<title>UK: KFW sets 500 million mark seven-year bond.</title>
<headline>KFW sets 500 million mark seven-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Westdeutsche Landesbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   KREDITANSTALT FUER WEIDERAUFBAU</p>
<p> AMT    500 MLN DEM   COUPON     5.00	MATURITY    12.FEB.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  98.525    PAY DATE    12.FEB.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  30 BP     LISTING    FFURT     PAY FREQ    ANNUAL</p>
<p> MOODY/S&amp;P  AAA/AAA   DENOMS (K) 10	  SALE LIMITS US/UK</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   IPMA 2</p>
<p> GOV LAW    GERMAN    MGT/UND    0.08	SELL CONC  0.22</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
